WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.280
¿Crees que

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.760
you really deserve

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.080
your father's trust?

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.800
At least your sister

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.120
has never embarrassed

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:06.800
our family.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.840
Your daughter

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.320
stole my husband!

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:09.880
Oh,

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.120
at least

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.720
it wasn't splashed

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.200
across every newspaper

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.080
in the country.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.920
And besides,

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.160
you've never worked

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.360
 a day in your life.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.520
How do you plan

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.480
on running a business?

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.520
Let's make a deal.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.440
If you can hold

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.880
any job

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.040
for a month,

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:32.920
you'll inherit

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.240
the family business.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:35.320
If not,

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.160
everything goes

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.000
to your sister.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.360
Deal.
